{"chapter": "desirables", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "02B5", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\noindent\n", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:06936a5d13e697deedac73b4d4a9a47108f07b33f84195a9c4e712bf57ece07b", "source_text": "This is basically just a list of things that we want to put in the stacks project. As we add material to the Stacks project continuously this is always somewhat behind the current state of the Stacks project. In fact, it may have been a mistake to try and list things we should add, because it seems impossible to keep it up to date.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:684a8f6e554493cf72dd1f20f7b2a2fae0aa7b3004511e71ac389562e23c25ed", "unit_id": "tag:02B5:p001"}
